{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Blindness.</b> A noun for the blemish of blindness — in feminine form — that there be in it no blemish of blindness." "<b>Or broken.</b> It shall not be." "<b>Split.</b> The eyelid that cracked or that was damaged, and likewise his lip that cracked or was damaged (Bekhorot 38)." "<b>Wart.</b> ורו״אה בְּלַעַ״ז." "<b>Scurf.</b> A kind of חֲזָזִית, and likewise יַלֶּפֶת; and the term יַלֶּפֶת is like ״וַיִּלְפֹּת שִׁמְשׁוֹן״ (Judges 16) — that cleaves to it until the day of death, for it has no cure." "<b>You shall not offer.</b> Three times — to warn against their consecration, against their slaughter, and against the sprinkling of their blood (Temurah 6)." "<b>And you shall not put.</b> Warning against burning them on the altar."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {3 "the la'az is Old French voroigne, 'wart'"}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:51.385167317Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}